WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.615
Numeric variables can also be classified by how the
values are generated Discrete

00:00:06.641 --> 00:00:12.142
variables usually come from counting events or units
Continuous

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:18.331
variables come from measurement and conceptually can
take values along a range Do

00:00:18.345 --> 00:00:23.891
not confuse the stored precision with the concept A
device may report

00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:28.917
a continuous physiological measurement as a whole
number because that is how the instrument records

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:29.128
it
